01:06:31.800 --> 01:06:32.280
But,

01:06:33.180 --> 01:06:35.440
it's not just words that connect us.

01:06:35.720 --> 01:06:37.340
What's important is

01:06:37.340 --> 01:06:38.500
our feelings.

01:06:38.820 --> 01:06:40.590
Believing that we can connect.

01:06:41.250 --> 01:06:41.730
Thinking.

01:06:42.260 --> 01:06:44.000
Long time ago,

01:06:44.000 --> 01:06:44.880
with Tano-chan...

01:06:45.000 --> 01:06:54.940
When I talked to you, your heart warmed up because I could feel your feelings, because you liked me!

01:07:08.636 --> 01:07:09.576
Thank you.

01:07:46.280 --> 01:07:51.100
Well, I'm a bird, too.

01:07:51.560 --> 01:07:52.240
Wow!

01:07:55.720 --> 01:07:59.140
What do you mean?

01:07:59.140 --> 01:07:59.340
What is this sound?

01:08:00.000 --> 01:08:01.480
There's a lot, Natsuki-san.

01:08:01.560 --> 01:08:05.460
I'll keep this a secret from now on.

01:08:05.480 --> 01:08:08.900
Even a sheep... Is this a bug?

01:08:09.360 --> 01:08:11.200
It's not a bug...

01:08:12.340 --> 01:08:15.280
Natsuki-san, why don't you come to Animal Town next time?

01:08:16.270 --> 01:08:20.260
It's a fun town with a lot of animals.

01:08:22.510 --> 01:08:25.920
Yeah, thank you.
